{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Grotto Diary&quot;is a first-person, Chinese-style horror game with a native setting, independently developed by a solo creator.The game is story-driven, incorporating gameplay elements such as stealth, chase sequences, and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place around the turn of the millennium, in the southern city of N.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hua Xiaoxi, a girl from Long Village, keeps vigil alone by her grandfather's sickbed. Still of school age, the weight of life already bears down on her young shoulders. Days of nightmares have left her physically and mentally exhausted, the horrifying visions and strange whispers lingering even after she wakes. She gradually realizes that the eerie fragments of her dreams are inextricably entangled with and mirror the hardships of her waking reality\u2014trapped even in consciousness. This fear is consuming her, bit by bit... until nothing remains. But will there still be hope? Save them... save the children...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/979e645871cd7d45dfb3086f3760fa96.poster.avif?t=1769923197\" width=1170 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/979e645871cd7d45dfb3086f3760fa96.webm?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/979e645871cd7d45dfb3086f3760fa96.mp4?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Narrative Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a work of fiction. Any resemblance to actual events or persons is coincidental.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story draws partial inspiration from multiple works by Lu Xun. This narrative seeks to extend his tradition of keen social observation and reinterpret its themes within a contemporary setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream and reality mirror each other throughout the story, creating a tale that is surreal, yet sharp with satire and truth. Perhaps... you might even catch a glimpse of your own reflection within it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/6fa7ec38e330c1d68036a00e7cd3457b.poster.avif?t=1769923197\" width=1170 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/6fa7ec38e330c1d68036a00e7cd3457b.webm?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/6fa7ec38e330c1d68036a00e7cd3457b.mp4?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Design</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this journey, you will encounter individuals who act as mirrors of reality. They may help you, influence you, or even harm you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In some of these characters\u2014or even your adversaries\u2014you may glimpse traces of Lu Xun's literary legacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/186c4e747772d41f73f06b7286acf0dd.poster.avif?t=1769923197\" width=1170 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/186c4e747772d41f73f06b7286acf0dd.webm?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/186c4e747772d41f73f06b7286acf0dd.mp4?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scene Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environments meticulously recreate the textures of different eras, immersing you in a site that transcends time.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are familiar with Lu Xun\u2019s\u00a0works, you may recognize traces of his literary spirit in the mottled walls and dim lamplight.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scenes are imbued with a unique Chinese-style horror atmosphere\u2014no excessive gore, yet an ever-present, lingering sense of unease.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/31fa6508e7b1ead856cd8e0951a6de3e.poster.avif?t=1769923197\" width=1170 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/31fa6508e7b1ead856cd8e0951a6de3e.webm?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/31fa6508e7b1ead856cd8e0951a6de3e.mp4?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is primarily presented in a first-person perspective, blending narrative sequences, stealth, chase scenes, and puzzle-solving as its core mechanics.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make may influence the game's difficulty, yet this design serves a singular purpose: to deepen your immersion and fully convey the narrative's tension.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/f7a16a3bd16deecba8a70ec22d459da8.poster.avif?t=1769923197\" width=1170 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/f7a16a3bd16deecba8a70ec22d459da8.webm?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/f7a16a3bd16deecba8a70ec22d459da8.mp4?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple endings, some of which require you to complete hidden challenges. Regardless of the path you take or the ending you reach, each journey will lead you to a deeper understanding of the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/c7c93017fad6307414a1ad6bfcabcf1d.poster.avif?t=1769923197\" width=1170 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/c7c93017fad6307414a1ad6bfcabcf1d.webm?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/c7c93017fad6307414a1ad6bfcabcf1d.mp4?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1602300?t=1769923197","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/2e15180207a98991b4465562a0e55001680af875/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769923197","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/d2d580482e7cad708846949926289097b7bc20b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769923197","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/d2d580482e7cad708846949926289097b7bc20b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769923197","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Grotto Diary&quot;is a first-person, Chinese-style horror game with a native setting, independently developed by a solo creator.The game is story-driven, incorporating gameplay elements such as stealth, chase sequences, and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place around the turn of the millennium, in the southern city of N.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hua Xiaoxi, a girl from Long Village, keeps vigil alone by her grandfather's sickbed. Still of school age, the weight of life already bears down on her young shoulders. Days of nightmares have left her physically and mentally exhausted, the horrifying visions and strange whispers lingering even after she wakes. She gradually realizes that the eerie fragments of her dreams are inextricably entangled with and mirror the hardships of her waking reality\u2014trapped even in consciousness. This fear is consuming her, bit by bit... until nothing remains. But will there still be hope? Save them... save the children...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/979e645871cd7d45dfb3086f3760fa96.poster.avif?t=1769923197\" width=1170 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/979e645871cd7d45dfb3086f3760fa96.webm?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor