ay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/186c4e747772d41f73f06b7286acf0dd.poster.avif?t=1769923197\" width=1170 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/186c4e747772d41f73f06b7286acf0dd.webm?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/186c4e747772d41f73f06b7286acf0dd.mp4?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scene Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environments meticulously recreate the textures of different eras, immersing you in a site that transcends time.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are familiar with Lu Xun\u2019s\u00a0works, you may recognize traces of his literary spirit in the mottled walls and dim lamplight.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scenes are imbued with a unique Chinese-style horror atmosphere\u2014no excessive gore, yet an ever-present, lingering sense of unease.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/31fa6508e7b1ead856cd8e0951a6de3e.poster.avif?t=1769923197\" width=1170 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/31fa6508e7b1ead856cd8e0951a6de3e.webm?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/31fa6508e7b1ead856cd8e0951a6de3e.mp4?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is primarily presented in a first-person perspective, blending narrative sequences, stealth, chase scenes, and puzzle-solving as its core mechanics.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make may influence the game's difficulty, yet this design serves a singular purpose: to deepen your immersion and fully convey the narrative's tension.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/f7a16a3bd16deecba8a70ec22d459da8.poster.avif?t=1769923197\" width=1170 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/f7a16a3bd16deecba8a70ec22d459da8.webm?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/f7a16a3bd16deecba8a70ec22d459da8.mp4?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple endings, some of which require you to complete hidden challenges. Regardless of the path you take or the ending you reach, each journey will lead you to a deeper understanding of the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/c7c93017fad6307414a1ad6bfcabcf1d.poster.avif?t=1769923197\" width=1170 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/c7c93017fad6307414a1ad6bfcabcf1d.webm?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602300/extras/c7c93017fad6307414a1ad6bfcabcf1d.mp4?t=1769923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video